    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musiischooda Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiinaada Sulemani aba madeeda heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA, aba madeeda eemeeda sean bea Israeli, ng'ata ghamiinda geatingaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sulemani ea nisin measayda gharinyeanda nea wiiloadaanyi geegala geatin muut, aba baraknataanyi geegala geatin muut, aba geawundaanyi geegala geatin samwagu, aba ng'ata ghwayiin doodooda, ng'ata ghamiinaada aba uhuudaanyi. Ng'ata gwatkuy aba madeeda guuyeeda fuga Israeli, ak ghamiinda geatingaaschi nea googeal humng'eeda, ak gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, nea ghanyea manda ASEETA uurjeeweey, aba humng'eeda ghana ng'eanyiida, ang'oonyi neajeeda nea goohiimu bariinyeega huumwa aba heeda fugaagu bea gadiyeeda badiina madeadaang'u aba gurooruunatka nyaawa sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ang'iing'eeda ghayi iisini sea siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi, was ghweandeanyu, gida ghayi iheeleesi ak ea huumwa, ghayi girgu aba ghuutaang'u, nea aba geatindaang'u ea niihiidi aba askwearjeanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ging'ulayi, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Israeli, nyaksiina siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda was Dawdeeda was ghweandeanyu gida ghayi iheeleesi sea niny, nea giyeeshi, ‘Mayramwasa aba madeedeanyu siichea goopteadawa hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda bea fuga Israeli, inyas diibigaagu gaygwashageat naweadinga nyaawa, nea ghoang'waay diigheanyeekeasu, gawuurji gida ibeadaati aba madeedeanyu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli, nung' ghwadaajiit ng'asheandaang'u, ghayi ibalooli siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ghamneawa ASEETA gayghoamu gwandeayi sea buuneeda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida? Ng'ula humng'eeda ea humng'eeda sheagi moamu ghoahiinyi; ak abeeda gay gawuurjiin gheawi eadeekneeyiin! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa ging'ulayi siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gidamusnyi, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU, aleeysiina iit shookaaschi, ea musiischooda sin siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda aba madeadaang'u; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda ghwajaada gheanyangaagu askweari ea eawa ak gang'ula gheawi, heeda ghayi iheeleesi gideaba gaymiinda gheawungaagu, ak abeeda gajiinya musiischooda sin siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda nea googeal hiji bea gheawiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda giileeysiit musiischooda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ea gea fugaagu was Israeli, iimusiischi aba hiji, ak giileeysiit nea gindi humng'eeda, heeda was hoorgeadaang'u, hean inyas giileeysiit abeeda, gibwaydi saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas siyagi ea niidiiysa giischeewoocheandaanyi, ak geanung' ghwaak habeawooda, inyas ghwahidu ak ghwaak habeawooda aba madeeda heeda wagiida aba jeedeaba gheawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda giileeysiit aba humng'eeda, ak gigadiiyi, ak giirgweaksi fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, ak giwaldi munyindaanyi, ak ginung' ghabwaspwas, ak giidawi doobiiwnata siida doabiiwaat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas fugaagu was Israeli gayghwajoar weajoodiga nyaawa aba gideaba nisineey riing'eeda, inyas gaygwayamu geat ak ghoapkaat gheawungaagu, ak gamusnyi nea gabadiischooweey ang'iing'i aba jeedeaba gheawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda giileeysiit aba humng'eeda, ak gisamsi riing'eega fugaagu bea Israeli, ak ginung' gabiigu gicha ng'eanyiida ghayi iidawi saawa ea ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas geateal humng'eeda, ak ghwaroat roopta aba gideaba nisineey riing'eeda, inyas gamusiischi nea goowiileesi geat hiji, ak ghoapkaachi gheawungaaschi, ak gwaduukuunana riing'eeda nyaawa, damanda inung' gwasawana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda giileaydiit aba humng'eeda, ak gisamsi riing'eega fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, was fugaagu was Israeli, nea giinaali gwasik naweeda doabiiwaat, jea gwasik; ak ginung' gwaroobassa ng'eanyiidaang'u, ghayi iidawi fugaagu ghoah hearaniischooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gwanda ng'eanyiida geejeeda, inyas gwanda ng'eanyiida dawuni, ghana nyoota roopta, ghana deashamga, ghana dakajeega; inyas gayghwanaw saawa weajoodiga nyaawa aba jeemba mujiinajeega nyaawa; ghana gwadeepa ea bileangida gil ghanea geeyooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gilinyoo gamus siyagi ghanea fugaagu sean gil bea Israeli, nea gaba siisi nala bileangidaanyi, nea ghamiinda geatingaaschi googeal hiji bea gheawiin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda giileaydiit aba humng'eeda, heeda iibiiti, ak gisamsi, ak gisisi gilinyoo nala gurooroadaanyi, gilinyoo gawuurji naweadingaaschi (aba gideaba ang'iing'i ginali gurooruunatka diibiga buuneeda); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gayghoawal gheanyangaagu, ak gabadiini nea gweadu geeshangaagu eawoojiga sean abiida jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi iidawi ghweanigaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak abeeda eara rabascheanda, maba jeeda fugaagu bea Israeli, iiwuna ng'eanyiida sheagi, aba ng'asheega gheawungaagu haw, ea geatindaang'u haw uur, ea geatindaang'u doabiiwaat, damanda wuna ak gamusiischi nea goofuursa geawi gheawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda giileeysiit aba humng'eeda was hoorgeadaang'u ak giidoabiiwi ng'asheega sean gawuurji gidamusiischeataneey rabascheanda, ak abeeda fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida gayghwanal gheawungaagu ak gayghoawal gheanyangaagu, gawuurji gisina fugaagu bea Israeli, ak abeeda gayghwanal gideaba gheawi aadeaschiin geeguuriideawa gheawungaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gaygaweay jarooda fugaagu gang'uchi sea weajoodiga nyaawa, aba naweeda jea ajeakteawana wassean, iimusnyi nea goofuursa geat mujiineani ghayi niloadiini, ea gheawi ghayi aadeaschi aba gheawungaaguun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda giileaydiit aba humng'eeda musiischooda nyaawa ea ghadooweeda nyaawa, ginung' gwajooriischi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gaygwasineey riing'eeda aba gideaba manda siisi moamu gwasin riing'eeda ak ginyareasi aba badahuuka nyaawa, ak giidaydi saawa ak giihaagi geatinga weajoodiga, ak abeeda gajeayaat ghoah giing'oonyanga aba ng'eanyiida sheagi, ghana dea neeki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
